  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<p>\n  <img src=\"docs/logo-258.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" alt=\"dsh-vision-router-inline\" />\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-vision-router-inline",
      "text": "**Fold Auto Vision twins into clear picture buttons on their original model rows.**\n\n<p>\n  <b>🇺🇸 English</b> | <a href=\"README.zh.md\">🇨🇳 简体中文</a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-vision-router-inline",
      "text": "<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DSH-plugin-4F8EF7?style=plastic\" alt=\"DSH plugin\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/ysr666/dsh-vision-router\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/requires-dsh--vision--router-0aa2c0?style=plastic\" alt=\"Requires: dsh-vision-router\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-2ea44f?style=plastic\" alt=\"License: MIT\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"package.json\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/version-0.1.1-informational?style=plastic\" alt=\"Version: 0.1.1\" /></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-vision-router-inline",
      "text": "<p>\n  <img src=\"docs/social-preview/en.png\" alt=\"dsh-vision-router-inline: Auto Vision folded into a picture button on each model row\" />\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\nDisplay companion for [`dsh-vision-router`](https://github.com/ysr666/dsh-vision-router)."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-vision-router-inline",
      "text": "`dsh-vision-router` adds a second provider group (`DeepSeek + 自动识图`, etc.). This plugin does not change that routing. It only changes display: fold each twin into a square picture button on the original model’s row. Click the name for the text model; click the button for that provider’s vision twin route (e.g. `google-vision` for Google). The button hover is separate from the row hover. The same button appears on the composer trigger and the Model row only while the vision route is selected."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-vision-router-inline",
      "text": "Example, one row:\n\n- Gemini 3.1 Pro　□ (vision)\n\nIf [dsh-better-ux](https://github.com/MitsukiJoe/dsh-better-ux) is also installed, its large picker shows the same picture button on each card.\n\n**This plugin does nothing unless `dsh-vision-router` is already loaded.** Install that first. If the router is missing, this package stays idle and does not wrap the model catalog."
    },
    {
      "section": "Requires",
      "text": "- [dsh-vision-router](https://github.com/ysr666/dsh-vision-router) ≥ 1.0\n- DeepSeek Harness web profile\n\nLoad order: `dsh-vision-router` first, then `dsh-vision-router-inline`."
    },
    {
      "section": "npm",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-vision-router@latest\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-vision-router-inline@latest\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "GitHub",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:ysr666/dsh-vision-router\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:MitsukiJoe/dsh-vision-router-inline\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Ask DSH",
      "text": "Send this message to DSH:\n\n```text\nInstall this plugin https://github.com/MitsukiJoe/dsh-vision-router-inline\n```\n\nRestart DSH after installation."
    },
    {
      "section": "Update",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web update dsh-vision-router dsh-vision-router-inline\n```\n\nOr send this message to DSH:\n\n```text\nUpdate this plugin https://github.com/MitsukiJoe/dsh-vision-router-inline\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Uninstall",
      "text": "Remove `dsh-vision-router-inline` from the web profile `package.json` and `node_modules`, restart DSH. `dsh-vision-router` itself is unchanged."
    }
  ],
